SUMMARY:Scenic AVL #7: Scott Mountain
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\nThere is very limited parking at t
 he [trailhead](https://maps.app.goo.gl/fETct2fiMiLz1HEG8). Please plan to 
 meet at Lake Hills Church parking lot at 10 minutes before the start to co
 ndense cars.\nLake Hills Church Parking Lot is pictured above.\n- [https:/
 /maps.app.goo.gl/X1TctrhYv3gihmh66](https://maps.app.goo.gl/X1TctrhYv3gihm
 h66)\n*Call the hike leader at 828-290-0886 if you cannot find us. Do not 
 text.\n\n**Rating**: Moderate\n**Elevation**: 800\n**Distance**: 5 miles\n
 **Surface**: Trail\n**Pace**: 3 mph\n**Dogs**: on leash.\n**Gear**: Long p
 ants recommended\, bug spray\, water. The ticks are bad on this trail. Bri
 ng your bug spray !\n**Features**: wooded trail\, interesting plants and f
 ungi. Bears are shy\, but we may see them\, also deer and squirrels. 3 mil
 es uphill\, 2.25 down.\n**All Trails Route**:\n[Scott Mountain Loop on All
 Trails](https://www.alltrails.com/explore/map/scott-mountain-loop-4217403?
 p=-1&sh=ifwm3x)\n\n[Scenic Asheville Series](https://docs.google.com/sprea
 dsheets/d/1XUm-X1_OhxKIi8JU5rhjsW37cAl4yYx8yB_NEjjI5Lk): there are 9 hikes
  in the series\, plus a few wild cards. Hike 9 of them and receive an [att
 ractive](https://docs.google.com/drawings/d/1goXUXfzUBqhB4_UeCxodlk4ZPeCCg
 qZrWK2EUJvk_vI/edit) badge for your backpack. If you have a badge \, you c
 an always come on\na hike \, even if you are on the waiting list .\nRSVP a
 nd On-Time Start:\n\n- If you decide you cannot come\, please change your 
 RSVP\n*If you must cancel\, please change your status to "Not Going" as so
 on as possible so wait-listers can have sufficient notice.\n- There are ge
 nerally 1 or 2 no-shows on my hikes\, so we don't wait for people to arriv
 e. If you are late\, you'll be left behind.\n*Please note that there is ne
 ver cell coverage at the start of the hike\, so please change your RSVP as
  soon as you know you can't make it.\n- Notes and comments are genuinely a
 ppreciated.\n\n**Guests**: Make sure your guests are fit enough to complet
 e the hike. if someone is a guest\, their hike will not count toward a bad
 ge because there will not be a record of their name .\n\nDisclaimer and Re
 lease of Liability:\nThis activity involves hiking on city streets that ma
 y have traffic. Participants are responsible for their safety on streets a
 nd trails. The organizer of this trip is a volunteer and not a professiona
 l guide. The function of the organizer is only to organize this trip. If y
 ou sign up or participate in this event you acknowledge that you freely an
 d voluntarily agree to assume all risks of injuries\, illnesses\, and dama
 ges arising from\, as a result of\, and associated with this event. In add
 ition\, you acknowledge that you agree to the Meetup terms: [https://www.m
 eetup.com/terms](https://www.meetup.com/terms)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/ashevillehikinggroup/events/314657184
 /
